DR_Lib_Founding_Text_0:
# 11 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“The Founding of Cormoria.”\p"
	.string "In the age before the Empire, when the\n"
	.string "tribes still wandered, a great darkness\l"
	.string "fell upon the land. A tribesman named\l"
	.string "Cormor went out against it with the\l"
	.string "beast Keerin at his side, and the\l"
	.string "darkness was driven from the world.\p"
	.string "From that deed he raised a kingdom, and\n"
	.string "the kingdom took his name.\p"
	.string "Someone has written in the margin, in a\n"
	.string "cramped hand: “Proof?”$"

DR_Lib_Legacy_Text_0:
# 16 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "A book lies open on the table.\p"
	.string "“The Legacy of Cormor.”\p"
	.string "The old tales tell of three stones, the\n"
	.string "Legacy of Cormor, brought together in\l"
	.string "the hour of the darkness. What became\l"
	.string "of them after, no two tellers agree.\p"
	.string "Some say they were scattered to the\n"
	.string "corners of the realm, some that the\l"
	.string "House of Cormoria keeps them still.$"

DR_Lib_Concordance_Text_0:
# 21 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“Of the Concordance.”\p"
	.string "The great Houses of the old days bent\n"
	.string "the knee to Cormor on one condition:\l"
	.string "that the making of laws stay with them.\l"
	.string "So was the Nobility Concordance born.\p"
	.string "No ruler since has governed without its\n"
	.string "leave, and the scholars count this the\l"
	.string "true reason the Empire has stood so\l"
	.string "long.$"

DR_Lib_Templars_Text_0:
# 26 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“The Order of the Templars.”\p"
	.string "The Templars serve Arceus in every city\n"
	.string "of the Empire. They keep the Taverns,\l"
	.string "where any traveller may eat, rest and\l"
	.string "see their Pokémon mended, and their\l"
	.string "riders bear folk between the cities on\l"
	.string "Braviary.\p"
	.string "Cormoria alone among the nations holds\n"
	.string "Arceus first and highest. Abroad, most\l"
	.string "peoples deny that Arceus exists at all.$"

DR_Lib_Names_Text_0:
# 31 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“On Names.”\p"
	.string "A House name is a sacrament, granted by\n"
	.string "the royal line alone in Arceus's sight,\l"
	.string "and no other may give one.\p"
	.string "Once only has the Crown suffered a\n"
	.string "name it did not give: the Ninth Trial's\l"
	.string "Baron, a Sinnohian orphan raised to\l"
	.string "Dawnstar, keeps his birth name Korolev\l"
	.string "by the Empress's own leave. Some of the\l"
	.string "old Houses have never forgiven it.$"

DR_Lib_West_Text_0:
# 36 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“The Faiths of the West.”\p"
	.string "Kanto and Johto are each ruled by a\n"
	.string "single great family, whose priests hold\l"
	.string "the throne's ear and whose law is their\l"
	.string "gods' law. They will not hear of Arceus.\p"
	.string "It was Kanto that took the Sevii Isles\n"
	.string "from Cormorian settlers, and the war\l"
	.string "that followed has never truly ended.$"

DR_Lib_Houses_Text_0:
# 41 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“The Great Houses and Their Arts.”\p"
	.string "Each of the old Houses keeps an art\n"
	.string "handed down the generations: Moray the\l"
	.string "mind, Nightfall the dark, Langerin the\l"
	.string "dead, Ashland the flame, Raptora the\l"
	.string "sky, Surge the storm, Alban the green.\p"
	.string "The Langerins keep the great\n"
	.string "Necropolis on Mt. Mirroh. The Ashlands\l"
	.string "came from a land far to the south and\l"
	.string "dwell inside Mt. Ceram itself.$"

DR_Lib_Jalviss_Text_0:
# 46 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“The Fall of House Jalviss.”\p"
	.string "House Jalviss delved deeper than any\n"
	.string "other and found the first Mega Stones\l"
	.string "in Cormoria. Their last delving woke a\l"
	.string "beast that had slept since before the\l"
	.string "Empire, and in one night the House was\l"
	.string "no more.\p"
	.string "Since then the law permits Mega\n"
	.string "Evolution only to those the Crown\l"
	.string "sanctions. The Jalviss ruins stand\l"
	.string "empty still, and few will go near them.$"

DR_Lib_Solomonar_Text_0:
# 51 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“The Solomonar.”\p"
	.string "The title of Solomonar is older than the\n"
	.string "Empire and is given only for true\l"
	.string "mastery of dragons. Cormor himself\l"
	.string "granted it once, in the third century of\l"
	.string "his reign.\p"
	.string "The name of that first Solomonar is\n"
	.string "lost; all that is remembered is that a\l"
	.string "Haxorus of rare colour fought at his\l"
	.string "side. None has held the title since.$"

DR_Lib_Ranks_Text_0:
# 56 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“Ranks of the Imperial Army.”\p"
	.string "Cadet, Lieutenant, Strategos,\n"
	.string "Windshear, Rainhawk, Tarasque,\l"
	.string "Dawnstar. Nine soldiers in ten never\l"
	.string "rise above Strategos.\p"
	.string "A Rainhawk is a soldier the Empire is\n"
	.string "watching, for from that rank come the\l"
	.string "Trial Barons, the guild masters and the\l"
	.string "founders of new Houses.$"

DR_Lib_Sinnoh_Text_0:
# 61 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“The Sinnoh Dispute.”\p"
	.string "Thirty years past, a quarrel over the\n"
	.string "border with Sinnoh came to blows, and\l"
	.string "many Sinnohian children were left\l"
	.string "without kin. The Empire took them into\l"
	.string "its military orphanages and raised them\l"
	.string "as its own.\p"
	.string "More than a few serve in the army today,\n"
	.string "and one rose higher than any soldier in\l"
	.string "living memory.$"

DR_Lib_Sevii_Text_0:
# 66 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“The Sevii Settlement.”\p"
	.string "Cormorian settlers tilled the Sevii\n"
	.string "Isles for generations, until Kanto came\l"
	.string "and took them. Johto and Hoenn joined\l"
	.string "Kanto against the Empire, envying its\l"
	.string "riches and fearing its strength.\p"
	.string "The fighting on the Sevii beaches was\n"
	.string "the bitterest of the war.$"

DR_Lib_Justice_Text_0:
# 71 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“Justice.”\p"
	.string "The guardian of the royal House is held\n"
	.string "to be a demigod, a form of the Ralts line\l"
	.string "found by Cormor in a chamber of strange\l"
	.string "metal.\p"
	.string "Philosophers have studied it for\n"
	.string "centuries. In all that time, no egg in\l"
	.string "the Empire has ever hatched its like.$"

DR_Lib_Hauntings_Text_0:
# 76 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“Hauntings of the West.”\p"
	.string "Ghost Pokémon gather about Hollow Hill\n"
	.string "as moths about a lamp, and none can say\l"
	.string "why. The fog there never fully lifts,\l"
	.string "and woodsmen tell of voices in it.\p"
	.string "The Langerins of Mt. Mirroh are called\n"
	.string "on when the lesser priests cannot quiet\l"
	.string "the dead.$"

DR_Lib_Dragons_Text_0:
# 81 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“Of Dragons.”\p"
	.string "Dragons are scarce in Cormoria, and\n"
	.string "have been as long as records go back.\l"
	.string "Some blame the desert clans of\l"
	.string "Seregmorn, who are said to hunt them.\p"
	.string "Whatever the cause, a dragon-tamer in\n"
	.string "the Empire is a rarer thing than a\l"
	.string "Vizier.$"

DR_Lib_Guilds_Text_0:
# 86 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“The Merchant Guilds.”\p"
	.string "Two guilds rule the Empire's trade.\n"
	.string "Sylphon & Stone deals in all a trainer\l"
	.string "needs, from balls and tonics to the\l"
	.string "hauling of Pokémon; Amber-Letz deals in\l"
	.string "bread, cloth and the goods of the\l"
	.string "household.\p"
	.string "A loose sheet of figures is tucked in\n"
	.string "the back. Someone has circled one sum\l"
	.string "in red ink and written beside it:\l"
	.string "“Where?”$"

DR_Lib_Athanto_Text_0:
# 91 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“A Traveller's Account of Athanto.”\p"
	.string "Far over the sea lies the kingdom of\n"
	.string "Athanto, which trades with the Empire\l"
	.string "but suffers no foreigner to settle\l"
	.string "within its borders. Its enchanters bind\l"
	.string "great power into masks and blades, and\l"
	.string "almost none of their work is ever sold\l"
	.string "abroad.\p"
	.string "Its lords give each child of noble birth\n"
	.string "a pup to raise, that the two may grow up\l"
	.string "together into knight and Arcanine.\p"
	.string "Above it all, on the highest mountain,\n"
	.string "dwells a guardian Pokémon with a fleece\l"
	.string "of gold. The Athantoans call it their\l"
	.string "true King, and no foreign power has ever\l"
	.string "gained a foothold while it keeps watch.\p"
	.string "A newer hand has added at the end:\n"
	.string "“Merchants back from Athanto talk of\l"
	.string "quarrels among its lords, and of whole\l"
	.string "forests felled to feed their armies.”$"

DR_Lib_Paldea_Text_0:
# 96 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "“Paldea.”\p"
	.string "Paldea is a young empire and a poor one.\n"
	.string "A Paldean is born a lord or a serf, and a\l"
	.string "serf may not learn his letters.\p"
	.string "Its envoys smile at the Cormorian\n"
	.string "court, but there is little love for the\l"
	.string "Empire in their country.$"

DR_Lib_Charter_Text_0:
# 101 "data/maps/PellucaAcademyLibrary/scripts.pory"
	.string "The Academy's charter rests on the\n"
	.string "stand.\p"
	.string "“Founded at Pelluca by Cadmus Umbra,\n"
	.string "Vizier of Education, under the Ministry\l"
	.string "of Education: the Eastern Charter\l"
	.string "Trainer Initiative.\p"
	.string "Here trainers shall learn to know their\n"
	.string "Pokémon before they learn to wield\l"
	.string "them.”$"
